{
  "id": "resolve-by-hand",
  "kind": "terminal",
  "language": "git",
  "title": {
    "tr": "Çakışmayı elle çöz",
    "en": "Resolve the conflict by hand"
  },
  "difficulty": 2,
  "prompt": {
    "tr": "prompt.tr.md",
    "en": "prompt.en.md"
  },
  "setup": [
    "mkdir shop",
    "cd shop",
    "git init",
    "echo \"Welcome\" > page.txt",
    "echo \"We sell books\" >> page.txt",
    "echo \"Open 9-17\" >> page.txt",
    "git add .",
    "git commit -m \"Add page\"",
    "git switch -c summer",
    "echo \"Welcome\" > page.txt",
    "echo \"We sell books\" >> page.txt",
    "echo \"Open 9-20\" >> page.txt",
    "git commit -am \"Summer hours\"",
    "git switch main",
    "echo \"Welcome\" > page.txt",
    "echo \"We sell books\" >> page.txt",
    "echo \"Open 8-17\" >> page.txt",
    "git commit -am \"Open earlier\""
  ],
  "cwd": "shop",
  "allow_fail": [
    0
  ],
  "solution": [
    "git merge summer",
    "cat page.txt",
    "echo \"Welcome\" > page.txt",
    "echo \"We sell books\" >> page.txt",
    "echo \"Open 8-20\" >> page.txt",
    "git add page.txt",
    "git commit --no-edit"
  ],
  "hints": [
    {
      "tr": "Dosyayı `echo` ile yeniden yaz: ilk satır `>`, sonrakiler `>>`. Sonra `git add page.txt` ve `git commit --no-edit`.",
      "en": "Rewrite the file with `echo`: first line `>`, the rest `>>`. Then `git add page.txt` and `git commit --no-edit`."
    },
    {
      "tr": "Çözümün tamamı (komutları sırayla yaz):\n\n```bash\ngit merge summer\ncat page.txt\necho \"Welcome\" > page.txt\necho \"We sell books\" >> page.txt\necho \"Open 8-20\" >> page.txt\ngit add page.txt\ngit commit --no-edit\n```",
      "en": "The full solution (type the commands in order):\n\n```bash\ngit merge summer\ncat page.txt\necho \"Welcome\" > page.txt\necho \"We sell books\" >> page.txt\necho \"Open 8-20\" >> page.txt\ngit add page.txt\ngit commit --no-edit\n```"
    }
  ],
  "checks": [
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "shop",
      "merge_commit": true,
      "no_conflicts": true,
      "last_message": "^Merge branch 'summer'$",
      "show_message": "Merge branch 'summer'",
      "label": {
        "tr": "Birleştirme bitti: Merge branch 'summer'",
        "en": "Merge finished: Merge branch 'summer'"
      }
    },
    {
      "type": "git_state",
      "repo": "shop",
      "head_files": {
        "page.txt": "Welcome\nWe sell books\nOpen 8-20"
      },
      "clean": true,
      "label": {
        "tr": "page.txt doğru üç satır",
        "en": "page.txt has the right three lines"
      }
    }
  ]
}
